stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Validated: schema + invariant validation
  Validated --> Tested: unit/negative/regression tests pass
  Tested --> Approved: two independent human approvers
  Approved --> Released: immutable digest + release manifest
  Released --> Active: distributed and pinned locally
  Active --> Deprecated: successor approved
  Deprecated --> Retired: no active runs / retention complete
  Active --> Suspended: incident or emergency stop
  Suspended --> Active: authorized remediation + retest
  Suspended --> Retired
